# License

## Scope: files ported from pebble-dash are not covered

These files are ported from [pebble-dash](https://github.com/myNameArnav/pebble-dash)
by myNameArnav:

- `src/shared/parser.js`
- `public/dashboard.html`
- `public/styles.css`
- `src/client/dashboard.js`

The pebble-dash repository has no licence, so by default its author keeps all
rights to that code. Those files are **not** licensed under the BSD-3-Clause
terms below, and anyone wanting to reuse them needs the original author's
permission. Their licensing is unresolved; this file will be updated if the
upstream author grants a licence.

Everything else in this repository is licensed under the BSD-3-Clause terms
below.

